        <div class=3D"markdown-body markdown-body-scrollable">
          <p dir=3D"auto">Before starting any meaningful task, I run the ta=
sk prompt through workspace-tuned /grill-me and /to-prd prompts. It forces =
the model to surface its assumptions upfront, gives me a spec I can split i=
nto parallel threads, and cuts down the "no, not like that" scenarios. I fi=
nd it to be a very good countermeasure against the model's over-eagerness</=
p>
