        <div class=3D"markdown-body markdown-body-scrollable">
          <p dir=3D"auto">Great post. How do you handle multiple repositori=
es and context management?  We have a mobile app, but we also have some bac=
kend processing tools.  We don't want to keep them together, but some proje=
cts end up spanning both, or more accurately, the info in one, informs how =
to work with the other.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Where does the /vault go for that?  How do you teach claude=
 the big picture of an enterprise while working in one section of it?</p>
        </div>
